{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11115220","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11115220","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1111522001:0":{"text":"끝났나요...?","source_cn":"结束了……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E6F795EB2F850AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1111522002:0":{"text":"제가 살아있다니... 믿을 수가 없어요.","source_cn":"我还活着……真不敢相信。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1467C1643563BEF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111522003:0":{"text":"안탄드라, 봤어요? 당신이 없는 동안 저도 든든한 전력으로 성장했어요.","source_cn":"安丹，看到了吗？你不在的这段时间，我也成长为可靠的战斗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5698976C81CFC6DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111522004:0":{"text":"사트라나 언니! 흐어엉... 사트라나 언니!","source_cn":"萨忒娜姐姐！呜呜呜……萨忒娜姐姐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BE4870CDBD7255E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111522005:0":{"text":"어어어? 요 꼬맹이가 갑자기 왜 이러는 거야!","source_cn":"哎哎哎？你这小孩，不要突然扑过来啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99A805E134F843FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111522006:0":{"text":"언니가 적들의 시선을 분산시키지 않았더라면 난 분명 안탄드라 언니를 다시 만나지 못했을 거야!","source_cn":"要不是你在战斗中干扰敌人！我肯定再也见不到安丹姐姐了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36513226450EE65F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111522007:0":{"text":"나는 언니가 안탄드라 언니를 빼앗아 갈 거라고 생각해서 계속 못되게 굴었는데, 그런데도 언니는 날 구해줬어! 고마워...","source_cn":"我以为你会抢走安丹姐，所以一直对你很凶，你却依然愿意救...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB82DCA2F6290F929","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111522008:0":{"text":"오늘부터 사트라나 언니랑 안탄드라 언니는 내가 세상에서 제일 좋아하는 사람이야!","source_cn":"从现在起，你和安丹姐姐都是我最喜欢的人了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6425C06F794E6B0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111522009:0":{"text":"그 마음 그냥 넣어둬. 가장 좋아하는 사람은 두 명일 수 없어. 너무 욕심내지 말라구.","source_cn":"哼，留着你的好意吧， 最喜欢的人只能有一个，你可不要太贪心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2712D801225B47C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111522010:0":{"text":"그럼 사트라나, 네가 가장 좋아하는 사람은 누구야?","source_cn":"谁又是萨忒娜心中最喜欢的人呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EB0FD09535FD0D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111522011:0":{"text":"천천히 한 번 생각해 봐요. 그 앞뒤 꽉꽉 막힌 머리로 언제쯤 깨달을지 두고 볼 테니까!","source_cn":"你慢慢想吧，以你的死脑筋，我看你多久才能想出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E7DF5F6D77094B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1111522012:0":{"text":"드디어 끝났어...","source_cn":"总算结束了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x660252414BF40547","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1111522013:0":{"text":"플루스토를 봉인하면 크림슨 고원이 정상으로 돌아올까?","source_cn":"将他封印后，深红高原就会恢复正常吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95091FF6A8A33BF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1111522014:0":{"text":"지금까지 겪었던 바로는 원상복구까지 시간이 좀 필요했어요.","source_cn":"以我们之前的经验，恢复需要时间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x665E64F504B2D588","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1111522015:0":{"text":"적어도 더 나빠지지는 않을 거예요. 차차 좋아질 일만 남은 거죠.","source_cn":"起码，事态不会进一步恶化了，只会渐渐好转。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B6626C7F008234C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1111522016:0":{"text":"마스터, 우리가 또 한 번 악마를 막았어요! 이제 세일린워터 마을로 돌아가서 제대로 축하해요!","source_cn":"主人，我们又一次解决了恶魔引发的危机，应该回咸水镇好好...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC8877724BC239EBF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 우리가 또 한 번 악마를 막았어요! 이제 세일린워터 마을로 돌아가서 제대로 축하해요!","female":"마스터, 우리가 또 한 번 악마를 막았어요! 이제 세일린워터 마을로 돌아가서 제대로 축하해요!","variant_male_record_index":"123410","variant_female_record_index":"123411","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1111522017:0":{"text":"축하는 무슨. 또 뭔가 맛있는 게 먹고 싶어진 거지? 이 식탐 귀신!","source_cn":"说什么想庆祝，其实你是嘴馋了，想吃点好的吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BC42A29AE01C151","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1111522018:0":{"text":"치피, 넌 마력만 있어도 충분한 서머너인데 왜 그렇게 식탐이 많은 거야?","source_cn":"满满，你明明是一只只需要补给魔力就能生存的使魔，却那么贪吃。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C6BE2B874E56191","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1111522019:0":{"text":"마스터... 해미가 괴롭혀요!","source_cn":"主人……漫漫欺负我！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6AD61F2AA51F6095","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터... 해미가 괴롭혀요!","female":"마스터... 해미가 괴롭혀요!","variant_male_record_index":"123414","variant_female_record_index":"123415","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1111522020:0":{"text":"치피! 이 고자질쟁이!","source_cn":"满满！你还学会告状了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03E9C66179CD18E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1111522021:0":{"text":"마스터! 해미 좀 어떻게 해주세요!","source_cn":"救命啊主人！您快管管漫漫啊！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDB027DCAA92A4D5A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터! 해미 좀 어떻게 해주세요!","female":"마스터! 해미 좀 어떻게 해주세요!","variant_male_record_index":"123417","variant_female_record_index":"123418","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1111522022:0":{"text":"이렇게 시끌시끌한 분위기도 오랜만인 것 같네.","source_cn":"久违了，这种吵吵闹闹的感觉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52577C7E7391A39E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1111522023:0":{"text":"아르사가 옆에 있었을 땐 항상 이렇게 떠들썩했는데.","source_cn":"在阿尔萨边上，耳旁总是这种声音。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5446581517FD4C0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:31:1111522023":{"text":"아르사가 옆에 있었을 땐 항상 이렇게 떠들썩했는데.","source_cn":"在阿尔萨边上，耳旁总是这种声音。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5446581517FD4C0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1111522024:0":{"text":"난 아무 말도 안 했어.","source_cn":"我可没说。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x38FA7FE44BCEF60E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"난 아무 말도 안 했어.","female":"난 아무 말도 안 했어.","variant_male_record_index":"123421","variant_female_record_index":"123422","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1111522025:0":{"text":"하지만 여기에 계속 있고 싶지는 않아.","source_cn":"但是，我也不想在这里继续待下去。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB1AB531257195901","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"하지만 여기에 계속 있고 싶지는 않아.","female":"하지만 여기에 계속 있고 싶지는 않아.","variant_male_record_index":"123423","variant_female_record_index":"123424","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1111522026:0":{"text":"세일린워터 마을로 돌아가자. 우리를 기다리고 있는 사람이 한둘이 아닐 거야.","source_cn":"走吧，回咸水镇。有很多人在等我们带回喜讯。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAA8CBD40CAFEDD7E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"세일린워터 마을로 돌아가자. 우리를 기다리고 있는 사람이 한둘이 아닐 거야.","female":"세일린워터 마을로 돌아가자. 우리를 기다리고 있는 사람이 한둘이 아닐 거야.","variant_male_record_index":"123425","variant_female_record_index":"123426","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:31:0:1":{"text":"아르사가 보고 싶구나?","source_cn":"想阿尔萨了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA536193054CC9C04","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아르사가 보고 싶구나?","female":"아르사가 보고 싶구나?","variant_male_record_index":"63736","variant_female_record_index":"63737","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:31:1:2":{"text":"집이 그리워?","source_cn":"想家了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x49BF984468B6586F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"집이 그리워?","female":"집이 그리워?","variant_male_record_index":"63738","variant_female_record_index":"63739","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:萨忒娜":{"text":"사트라나","source":"萨忒娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡卡